⍝ Power.tc
⍝ ════════

⍝@ test4.

      ⎕IO←1

      ⍝ Precond: A B Z numeric
      ⍝ inv: A*E1+E2 ←→ (A*E1)×A*E2   (law of exponents)
      A ← 1+(|⎕RVAL 1 (,4) (,0 0 1 0 0))     ⍝ positive base
      E1 ← ⎕RVAL 1 (,4) (,0 0 1 0 0)
      E2 ← ⎕RVAL 1 (,4) (,0 0 1 0 0)
      (A*E1+E2) ≡ (A*E1)×A*E2
1
